<title>GERMANY: Ruetgers wants to sell Goldschmidt stake to Viag.</title>
<headline>Ruetgers wants to sell Goldschmidt stake to Viag.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ruetgers AG said on Friday it wants to sell its stake in chemicals company Th. Goldschmidt AG to Viag for a price in line with its 236 million mark book value.</p>
<p>Ruetgers, a Ruhrkole subsidiary, said it has reached a basic understanding with the other parties.  </p>
<p>Ruetgers wants to sell Goldschmidt stake to Viag</p>
<p>Ruetgers wrote off about 85 million marks last year on its 29 percent stake in Goldschmidt.</p>
<p>With the Ruetgers stake, Viag and its SKW Trostberg unit would have a combined stake of 46 percent in Goldschmidt.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49 228 2609750</p>
</text>
